ZCL_MODULE_CAPABILITY("tools/command/native_dev_land_offer.c", CAP_FS_READ|CAP_FS_WRITE, "reads an offered bundle and manifest for check_offer and attest_offer, writes the attest_offer receipt, reads a receipt and offer for verify_offer_receipt, and for reverify_offer copies the repository's build/bin/z23-lint into a scratch worktree under a private temp directory (removed again) and sets its mode; every git and dev cx check child goes through the spawn seam with an argv and no shell")
